    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/d5fba07dbead2acb33e6d2331b698562.poster.avif?t=1754064781\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/d5fba07dbead2acb33e6d2331b698562.webm?t=1754064781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/d5fba07dbead2acb33e6d2331b698562.mp4?t=1754064781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/c9909d5d6911cc4455a91aa1cba4823d.avif?t=1754064781\" data-has-big width=800 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist finds themselves lost in a remote mountain village in Japan.<br>In this village, a mysterious legend tells of monsters that attack humans.<br>With the help of various companions, the protagonist must unravel the mysteries of the village, armed with a flashlight and a stun gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/1c1de98f85c2fe9d4f0fce99e9db4327.poster.avif?t=1754064781\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/1c1de98f85c2fe9d4f0fce99e9db4327.webm?t=1754064781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/1c1de98f85c2fe9d4f0fce99e9db4327.mp4?t=1754064781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/83f34b9821bcfa2f2b3ed369d055b9b3.avif?t=1754064781\" data-has-big width=800 height=57 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use, equip, and combine randomly spawned items to progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth action: sneak past monsters unnoticed or use your stun gun to strike when necessary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon exploration: solve diverse puzzles and utilize unique mechanics to overcome challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/ecffcc9669dfc2a328802130293956a6.poster.avif?t=1754064781\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/ecffcc9669dfc2a328802130293956a6.webm?t=1754064781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/ecffcc9669dfc2a328802130293956a6.mp4?t=1754064781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/d5fba07dbead2acb33e6d2331b698562.poster.avif?t=1754064781\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/d5fba07dbead2acb33e6d2331b698562.webm?t=1754064781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/d5fba07dbead2acb33e6d2331b698562.mp4?t=1754064781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/c9909d5d6911cc4455a91aa1cba4823d.avif?t=1754064781\" data-has-big width=800 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist finds themselves lost in a remote mountain village in Japan.<br>In this village, a mysterious legend tells of monsters that attack humans.<br>With the help of various companions, the protagonist must unravel the mysteries of the village, armed with a flashlight and a stun gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/1c1de98f85c2fe9d4f0fce99e9db4327.poster.avif?t=1754064781\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/1c1de98f85c2fe9d4f0fce99e9db4327.webm?t=1754064781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/1c1de98f85c2fe9d4f0fce99e9db4327.mp4?t=1754064781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/83f34b9821bcfa2f2b3ed369d055b9b3.avif?t=1754064781\" data-has-big width=800 height=57 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use, equip, and combine randomly spawned items to progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth action: sneak past monsters unnoticed or use your stun gun to strike when necessary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon exploration: solve diverse puzzles and utilize unique mechanics to overcome challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/ecffcc9669dfc2a328802130293956a6.poster.avif?t=1754064781\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/ecffcc9669dfc2a328802130293956a6.webm?t=1754064781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/ecffcc9669dfc2a328802130293956a6.mp4?t=1754064781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
